      "outcome": "Creates boundaries that prevent scope creep and make the offer tangible vs. abstract service",
      "difficulty_level": "Medium"
    },
    {
      "action": "Simplify your mechanism to 2-3 steps: 'We [step 1]. Then we [step 2]. You get [outcome] without [dreaded thing]'",
